sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Host
  participant R as Runtime (tick)
  participant L as Log
  participant M as LLM
  participant T as Tool
  U->>R: prompt("fix the test")
  R->>L: run/started + user (atomic)
  loop while decide asks for something
    R->>L: model/requested (system + offered tools)
    R->>M: streamText (deltas → live, ephemeral)
    M-->>R: response
    R->>L: model/responded
    par for each tool call
      R->>L: tool/started
      R->>T: hooks tool.before → execute (may emit plugin events) → tool.after
      R->>L: tool/finished
    end
    R->>L: user (queued steers, if any)
  end
  R->>L: run/ended (or user with followUps and continues)
  Note over R,L: After a restart: fold the log and decide yields exactly what was missing
